		<h6 style="font-size: calc(12px + 2vmax);">Fight With Your Mind is an activism and advocacy organization with a mission to fight information warfare by teaching how it is used and why it is effective.</h6>
		<p>Our goal is to bring truth and a shared reality back into focus by challenging the public to question and analyze information, and better understand our differences through expertise, education, and empathy.</p>
